    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Another Supermarket\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, chaotic supermarket simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Supermarket Simulator to rule them all, it has everything: building system, economy, management, research trees, upgrades, stubborn customers, sneaky little thieves, zombies(?)...zombies?? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yep, it has zombies, when the night falls you have to protect your lovely retail gem. Good luck with that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nice Little Building System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/455acac6fbe9cfe74c3c6dfe2c7fdf56.poster.avif?t=1745486009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/455acac6fbe9cfe74c3c6dfe2c7fdf56.webm?t=1745486009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/455acac6fbe9cfe74c3c6dfe2c7fdf56.mp4?t=1745486009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your store, your decoration, your imagination. Who knows better? An architect? An interior designer? NOOO, it's you who played that life sim all of your childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Niaah that's What the Low Rent was About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/b52891f2f3ae51d0a4a38d5c4f8c9bb6.poster.avif?t=1745486009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/b52891f2f3ae51d0a4a38d5c4f8c9bb6.webm?t=1745486009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/b52891f2f3ae51d0a4a38d5c4f8c9bb6.mp4?t=1745486009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woohooy our cutie little store is full of people, better get to work!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Filthy Little Thieves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/5e70fc5783ae8153b99ed84092df09c2.poster.avif?t=1745486009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/5e70fc5783ae8153b99ed84092df09c2.webm?t=1745486009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382350/extras/5e70fc5783ae8153b99ed84092df09c2.mp4?t=1745486009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Camera System is your friend, or better, security staff, or even better z-ray laser turrets, unlock them all and never miss a penny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
